[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692432458","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103438#issuecomment-2692432458","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103438","id":2692432458,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ge0JK","user":{"login":"TrueJole","id":121569485,"node_id":"U_kgDOBz8AzQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121569485?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole","html_url":"https://github.com/TrueJole","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-01T21:40:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-01T21:40:14Z","body":"I tested around a bit and this seemed to fix it: \n\n```c++\nint Callable::get_argument_count(bool *r_is_valid) const {\n\tif (is_valid()) {\n\t\tif (is_custom()) {\n\t\t\tbool valid = false;\n\t\t\treturn custom->get_argument_count(r_is_valid ? *r_is_valid : valid);\n\t\t} else if (!is_null()) {\n\t\t\treturn get_object()->get_method_argument_count(method, r_is_valid);\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\tif (r_is_valid) {\n\t\t\t\t*r_is_valid = false;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn 0;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\telse {\n\t\tERR_PRINT(\"Callable is not valid\");\n\t\treturn 0;\n\t}\n}\n``` \nI added the is_valid() check. I don't know what a good error message would so I just went with that. \nI am new to contributing to the source code and can't open a pull request because I already have an open one (and unfortunately did it on the main branch).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692432458/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692553173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103438#issuecomment-2692553173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103438","id":2692553173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gfRnV","user":{"login":"Hot-key","id":20187669,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTg3NjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20187669?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key","html_url":"https://github.com/Hot-key","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hot-key/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-02T04:34:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T04:34:46Z","body":"@TrueJole Thanks for the solution! Is it okay if I make a PR with this fix?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692553173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,